  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation EU for Employment and Social Inclusion - AL2024AAP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The action aims to provide support to the Government&#xbf;s priorities towards advancing labour market policies and social welfare reforms that foster equal opportunities, decent work and the wellbeing of the population. The main objective of the action is to expand coverage, inclusiveness, effectiveness and shock-responsiveness of social protection and labour market measures, including categories at risk of exclusion. The specific objectives are linked with (i) enhancing the governance systems and delivery instruments for better jobs and employability of the labour force, including skills development for young people and adults, in line with the European Skills Agenda; and (ii) improving the adequacy of social protection measures and accessibility and quality of integrated social care measures. These objectives directly respond to the structural challenges currently faced by the country.</narrative>
  </description>
